    "text": "Petrol Re1 mehnga, nayi qeemat Rs323 fi litre! ⛽\nBusiness Recorder ke mutabiq OGRA ne Thursday ko notification jaari kiya, jis ke mutabiq petrol ki qeemat Rs322 se barh kar Rs323 fi litre ho gayi hai. Diesel ki qeemat Rs355 fi litre par barqarar rahegi. Naye rates Friday, 20 November ke liye hain. Is se pehle petrol kai baar lagataar sasta kiya gaya tha.\nPetrol ki nayi qeemat par aap ka kya khayal hai? Comment mein batayein 👇\n\nImage: AI-generated illustration.\n\n#RiseUpPakistan #PetrolPrice #OGRA #Diesel #PakistanNews",
